# Pairs with HintOnlyWhileOpen. Design section 3 (S7): the hint and the open
# marker are one write of the shard's hand-off row. Storing the hint alone leaves
# a hint no open switch owns, which no close removes.
MODULE: HintOnlyWhileOpenBeginWithoutToken
TARGET: HintOnlyWhileOpen
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the birth hint is stored without opening the switch token in the same write
PERTURBS: Begin

--- FIND
                IN /\ hint' = h
                   /\ tokOpen' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
                IN /\ hint' = h
\* MUTATION: the token is not opened with the hint.
                   /\ tokOpen' = tokOpen
--- END
